## Context
Parent: 1229. `scripts/prompt-project-coherence.sh` (called from
`scripts/on-start-context.sh`) asks the model for a coherence pass at every
session start in every project with local directives. Once `yawn` and `molt`
carry the check on demand (1230, 1231), the per-session prompt is a recurring
cost with no owner decision behind each run.

## Exit criteria
- [ ] The `PROJECT DIRECTIVE COHERENCE` prompt is no longer emitted
- [ ] The zero-LLM `resident_census.py --warn` budget line is kept
- [ ] Its tests are deleted with it, not tuned; Codex and Pi start hooks that
      share `on-start-context.sh` are checked for the same removal
- [ ] Lands after 1230 and 1231 are merged
